<title>FRANCE: Cie Bancaire aims for 15 pct ROE in 2001.</title>
<headline>Cie Bancaire aims for 15 pct ROE in 2001.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cie Bancaire, a unit of Cie Financiere de Paribas, aims to have a return on shareholders' equity near 15 percent in 2001, up from 10 percent currently, its chairman Bernard Muller said in an interview.</p>
<p>&quot;Our goal is to approach 15 percent return on shareholders' equity in 2001,&quot; he told investment weekly Valeurs Actuelles due to be published on Saturday.</p>
<p>He said Cie de Bancaire's recently announced buyout of two units, Cardif et UFB Locabail, would accelerate progress toward that objective.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
